If it grants access to an account or service, store it as a secret.","environment.form.runtimeConfiguration":"Runtime configuration","environment.form.runtimeConfigurationTooltip":"Control how your project starts in the cloud. E.g. If your app needs npm run dev, set it here.","environment.form.configurationManually":"Configuration Manually","environment.form.installScript":"Install script","environment.form.installScriptTooltip":"Runs when the environment starts, usually to install dependencies.","environment.form.startScript":"Start script","environment.form.startScriptTooltip":"Runs your app after setup.","environment.form.defaultTerminals":"Default Shell","environment.form.defaultTerminalsTooltip":"Configure background tasks running in parallel with the main app (e.g., DB, tests, logs).","environment.form.addTerminal":"Add Terminal","environment.form.terminalName":"Name","environment.form.terminalNamePlaceholder":"e.g., dev","environment.form.terminalCommand":"Command","environment.form.terminalCommandPlaceholder":"e.g., npm run dev","environment.form.cancel":"Cancel","environment.form.confirm":"Confirm","environment.form.unconfirmedEnvVars":"Please complete or remove unconfirmed environment variables","environment.form.unconfirmedSecrets":"Please complete or remove unconfirmed secrets","environment.form.creating":"Creating...","environment.form.saving":"Saving...","environment.form.submitError":"Submit failed, please try again","environment.panel.title":"Cloud Environments","environment.panel.description":"A ready-to-use default environment is provided. Create your own if you need specific versions or extra dependencies.","environment.panel.learnMore":"Custom environments apply only to cloud tasks. Local runs use your machine\'s environment. <link>Learn more</link>","environment.delete.title":"Delete this custom environment?","environment.delete.description":"Once deleted, this environment and its settings will be permanently removed.","command.panel.title":"Com