tings_plugins_section_title":"Plugins","settings_plugins_source_claude":"From Claude Code","settings_plugins_source_codex":"From Codex","settings_plugins_tab_global":"Global","share_link":"Share Link","share_the_code_practice_experience_and_get_a_limited_number_of_customized_periph":"Share the code practice experience and get a limited number of customized peripherals","showDiff":"Show Diff","show_all":"Show all","show_all_tooltip":"Include archived versions and all unstable versions in the version list","show_api_key":"Show","show_device_toolbar":"Show Device Toolbar","show_tasks":"Show Tasks","skd_installed":"{displayName} {version} installed","skill_market.desc.alipay_skills.alipay_payment_integration":"A best practice guide for integrating Alipay payment products, covering all scenarios from in-person to online payments","skill_market.desc.anthropics_skills.algorithmic_art":"Create algorithmic art using p5.js with seeded randomness and interactive parameter exploration, including flow fields and particle systems.","skill_market.desc.anthropics_skills.brand_guidelines":"Apply Anthropic\'s official brand colors and typography to artifacts for consistent visual formatting and company design standards.","skill_market.desc.anthropics_skills.canvas_design":"Create original visual art, posters, and designs as .png or .pdf documents using design philosophy, without copying existing artists.","skill_market.desc.anthropics_skills.doc_coauthoring":"Guide users through a structured co-authoring workflow for documentation, proposals, technical specs, and decision docs.","skill_market.desc.anthropics_skills.frontend_design":"Build distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with polished UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","skill_market.desc.anthropics_skills.internal_comms":"Write internal communications in company-preferred formats, including status reports, leadership updates, newsletters, incident reports, and FAQs.","skill_market.desc.anthropics_skills.mcp_builder":"A guide for building high-quality MCP servers that connect LLMs to external APIs and services","skill_market.desc.anthropics_skills.theme_factory":"Style artifacts such as slides, docs, and HTML pages with 10 pre-set themes or custom on-the-fly generated themes.","skill_market.desc.anthropics_skills.web_artifacts_builder":"Build complex, multi-component HTML artifacts using React, Tailwind CSS, and shadcn/ui for projects requiring state management or routing.","skill_market.desc.anthropics_skills.webapp_testing":"Test and debug local web applications using Playwright, with support for screenshots and browser log inspection.","skill_market.desc.bytedance_agentkit_samples.byted_seedance_video_generate":"Generate videos from text prompts, images, or reference materials using Seedance models.","skill_market.desc.bytedance_agentkit_samples.byted_seedream_image_generate":"Generate high-quality images from text prompts using Volcano Engine Seedream, supporting multiple artistic styles and aspect ratios.","skill_market.desc.bytedance_agentkit_samples.hook_analyzer":"Extract and analyze the first three seconds of video shot breakdowns to provide structured context for hook attraction evaluation.","skill_market.desc.bytedance_agentkit_samples.hook_analyzer_skill":"Extract and analyze the first three seconds of video shot breakdowns to provide structured context for hook attraction evaluation.","skill_market.desc.bytedance_agentkit_samples.report_generator":"Generate professional Markdown video analysis reports by integrating shot breakdown data and hook analysis results.","skill_market.desc.bytedance_agentkit_samples.report_generator_skill":"Generate professional Markdown video analysis reports by integrating shot breakdown data and hook analysis results.","skill_market.desc.bytedance_deer_flow.chart_visualization":"Intelligently select from 26 chart types to visualize data and generate chart images based on detailed specifications.","skill_market.desc.bytedance_deer_flow.consulting_analysis":"Produce consulting-grade research reports in two phases: a structured analysis framework, followed by a final report with narratives, embedded charts, and strategic insights.","skill_market.desc.bytedance_deer_flow.data_analysis":"Analyze Excel and CSV files with support for multi-sheet workbooks, aggregation, filtering, joins, and export to CSV, JSON, or Markdown.","skill_market.desc.github_awesome_copilot.gh_cli":"A comprehensive GitHub CLI (gh) reference for managing repositories, issues, pull requests, Actions, projects, releases, and all GitHub operations from the command line.","skill_market.desc.github_awesome_copilot.git_commit":"Execute git commits with intelligent staging, auto-detected conventional commit message generation, and support for type, scope, and description overrides.","skill_market.desc.kepano_obsidian_skills.defuddle":"Extract clean Markdown from web pages using Defuddle CLI, removing clutter and navigation to save tokens.","skill_market.desc.kepano_obsidian_skills.json_canvas":"Create and edit JSON Canvas files with nodes, edges, groups, and connections for visual canvases and mind maps.","skill_market.desc.kepano_obsidian_skills.obsidian_bases":"Create and edit Obsidian Bases (.base files) with views, filters, formulas, and summaries for database-like note management.","skill_market.desc.kepano_obsidian_skills.obsidian_cli":"Interact with Obsidian vaults via CLI to read, create, search, and manage notes, tasks, and properties, with support for plugin and theme development.","skill_market.desc.kepano_obsidian_skills.obsidian_markdown":"Write and edit Obsidian Flavored Markdown with wikilinks, embeds, callouts, properties, and Obsidian-specific syntax.","skill_market.desc.makenotion_notion_cookbook.knowledge_capture":"Transform conversations and discussions into structured Notion documentation pages, saved to wikis or databases with proper organization and linking.","skill_market.desc.makenotion_notion_cookbook.meeting_intelligence":"Prepare meeting materials by gathering Notion context and research, then saving both an internal pre-read and external agenda to Notion.","skill_market.desc.makenotion_notion_cookbook.research_documentation":"Search across your Notion workspace, synthesize findings, and save comprehensive research reports as new Notion pages.","skill_market.desc.makenotion_notion_cookbook.spec_to_implementation":"Break down product or tech specs into detailed Notion implementation tasks with acceptance criteria and progress tracking.","skill_market.desc.makenotion_skills.notion_cli":"Interact with the Notion API via the ntn CLI to manage workers, upload files, create pages, and query databases.","skill_market.desc.obra_superpowers.brainstorming":"Explore user intent, requirements, and design before implementation to ensure creative work is well-planned and aligned with expectations.","skill_market.desc.obra_superpowers.executing_plans":"Execute a written implementation plan in a separate session with structured review checkpoints.","skill_market.desc.obra_superpowers.test_driven_development":"Write tests before implementation code to validate feature or bugfix requirements through a test-driven development workflow.","skill_market.desc.obra_superpowers.writing_plans":"Create a structured implementation plan from a spec or requirements before touching any code for a multi-step task.","skill_market.desc.openai_skills.figma":"Fetch design context, screenshots, variables, and assets from Figma via MCP server, and translate Figma nodes into production code.","skill_market.desc.openai_skills.figma_implement_design":"Translate Figma designs into production-ready application code with 1:1 visual fidelity.","skill_market.desc.openai_skills.frontend_skill":"Build visually strong landing pages, websites, apps, prototypes, and game UIs with restrained composition and tasteful motion.","skill_market.desc.openai_skills.jupyter_notebook":"Create, scaffold, or edit Jupyter notebooks (.ipynb) for experiments, explorations, or tutorials using bundled templates.","skill_market.desc.openai_skills.playwright":"Automate real browser tasks from the terminal including navigation, form filling, snapshots, screenshots, and data extraction via playwright-cli.","skill_market.desc.openai_skills.playwright_interactive":"Persistent browser and Electron interaction through js_repl for fast iterative UI debugging.","skill_market.desc.openai_skills.screenshot":"Capture desktop or system screenshots at full screen, app window, or pixel region level when tool-specific capture is unavailable.","skill_market.desc.openai_skills.security_best_practices":"Review code for security best practices and suggest improvements, supporting Python, JavaScript/TypeScript, and Go.","skill_market.desc.openai_skills.slides":"Build and edit PowerPoint decks (.pptx) with layout helpers and validation, supporting charts, visuals, and diagnosing overflow or overlap issues.","skill_market.desc.redis_agent_skills.redis_development":"Apply Redis best practices and performance optimization across data structures, vector search (RedisVL), semantic caching (LangCache), and the Redis Query Engine.","skill_market.desc.shadcn_ui_ui.shadcn":"Manage shadcn components and projects \u2014 adding, searching, fixing, debugging, styling, and composing UI with component docs and usage examples.","skill_market.desc.vercel_labs_agent_browser.agent_browser":"Automate browser interactions for AI agents \u2014 navigating pages, filling forms, clicking buttons, scraping data, and testing web apps via CLI.","skill_market.desc.vercel_labs_agent_browser.dogfood":"Systematically dogfood and QA web applications, producing structured bug reports with screenshots, repro videos, and step-by-step reproduction steps.","skill_market.desc.vercel_labs_agent_browser.electron":"Automate Electron desktop apps (VS Code, Slack, Discord, Figma, etc.) using agent-browser via Chrome DevTools Protocol.","skill_market.desc.vercel_labs_agent_skills.composition_patterns":"Design scalable React component architectures using composition patterns including compound components, render props, and context providers, with React 19 updates.","skill_market.desc.vercel_labs_agent_skills.react_best_practices":"Apply Vercel Engineering\'s React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines when writing, reviewing, or refactoring code.","skill_market.desc.vercel_labs_agent_skills.react_native_skills":"Apply React Native and Expo best practices for building performant mobile apps, covering animations, list optimization, and native platform APIs.","skill_market.desc.vercel_labs_agent_skills.web_design_guidelines":"Review UI code for Web Interface Guidelines compliance, checking accessibility, design quality, and UX best practices.","skill_market.sync.btn_retry":"Retry","skill_market.sync.btn_upload":"Upload","skill_market.sync.btn_uploading":"Uploading","skill_market.sync.tooltip_failed":"Upload failed, click to retry","skill_market.sync.upload":"Upload to cloud","skill_market.sync.uploaded":"Uploaded","skill_market.sync_confirm.cancel":"Cancel","skill_market.sync_confirm.confirm":"Confirm","skill_market.sync_confirm.description":"Content will be uploaded to the TRAE Cloud environment. Please confirm it contains no sensitive information","skill_market.sync_confirm.title":"Upload to cloud?","skill_market.text.all":"All","skill_market.text.built_in":"Built-in","skill_market.text.by_author":"By {name}","skill_market.text.content_creation":"Content Creation","skill_market.text.data_analysis":"Data Analysis","skill_market.text.detail.disable":"Disable","skill_market.text.detail.enable":"Enable","skill_market.text.detail.install":"Install","skill_market.text.detail.runSkill":"Run Skill","skill_market.text.detail.skills":"Included Skills","skill_market.text.detail.uninstall":"Uninstall","skill_market.text.developer_tools":"Developer Tools","skill_market.text.disable":"Disable","skill_market.text.empty.def