i.settings.autoRun.sandbox_unavailable.to_recovery/auto_recovery_needs_privilege.description":"The system\u2019s sandbox is limited, but you can generate a project-specific sandbox configuration. Please copy and run the configuration command (sudo required) to set up the project-level sandbox.\\n If not restored, under \u201CSandbox with Allowlist\u201D, allowlisted commands run automatically, while others require manual execution. Automatic execution and evaluation in the sandbox are unavailable. {link}","icd.ai.settings.autoRun.sandbox_unavailable.to_recovery/auto_recovery_needs_privilege.title":"The sandbox needs to be configured","icd.ai.settings.autoRun.sandbox_unavailable.to_recovery/auto_recovery_none_privilege.description":"The system\u2019s sandbox is limited, but you can generate a project-specific sandbox configuration. Please copy and run the configuration command (sudo required) to set up the project-level sandbox.\\n If not restored, under \u201CSandbox with Allowlist\u201D, allowlisted commands run automatically, while others require manual execution. Automatic execution and evaluation in the sandbox are unavailable. {link}","icd.ai.settings.autoRun.sandbox_unavailable.to_recovery/auto_recovery_none_privilege.title":"The sandbox needs to be configured","icd.ai.settings.autoRun.sandbox_unavailable.to_recovery/user_manual_recovery_kernel.description":"The current system\u2019s sandbox is limited, but you can restore it by configuring the system environment. Please check {link} and complete the setup; the sandbox will be enabled after restart.\\n If not restored, under \\"Sandbox with Allowlist\\", allowlisted commands run automatically, while others require manual execution. Sandbox automatic execution and evaluation are unavailable.","icd.ai.settings.autoRun.sandbox_unavailable.to_recovery/user_manual_recovery_kernel.title":"Sandbox Recoverable","icd.ai.settings.autoRun.sandbox_unavailable.unavailable.description":"The current system does not support sandbox. When using the \\"Sandbox with Allowlist\\", allowlisted commands can still run automatically, while other commands must be executed manually. Automatic execution and evaluation in the sandbox are not available. { link }","icd.ai.settings.autoRun.sandbox_unavailable.unavailable.title":"Sandbox Unavailable","icd.ai.settings.autoRun.tips.v2":"Choose how the agent executes commands. It is recommended to use the safer \\"Sandbox with Allowlist\\" way.","icd.ai.settings.autoRun.title":"Command Execution","icd.ai.settings.autoRun.whitelist.tips":"If the command is in the Allowlist, it will be executed automatically outside the sandbox.","icd.ai.settings.enterprise_blacklist_commands.collapse":"Collapse","icd.ai.settings.enterprise_blacklist_commands.description":"Enterprise has enabled high-risk command control. Related commands will be blocked. This policy takes priority over custom whitelists.","icd.ai.settings.enterprise_blacklist_commands.expand":"Show More","icd.ai.settings.enterprise_blacklist_commands.title":"Enterprise Command Blacklist","icd.ai.settings.sandbox.customConfig.button":"Open Configuration","icd.ai.settings.sandbox.customConfig.description":"Configure filesystem access rules for the sandbox environment. {docsLink}","icd.ai.settings.sandbox.customConfig.description.withNetwork":"Configure filesystem and network access rules for the sandbox environment. {docsLink}","icd.ai.settings.sandbox.customConfig.label":"Custom Sandbox Configuration","icd.ai.settings.sandbox.enterpriseConfig.button":"View Configuration","icd.ai.settings.sandbox.enterpriseConfig.description":"The sandbox access rules are configured and maintained by the enterprise. Members cannot modify them.","icd.ai.settings.sandbox.enterpriseConfig.label":"Enterprise Sandbox Policy","icd.ai.settings.sandbox.enterpriseConfig.tooltip":"Enterprise sandbox configuration takes priority; only when a field is missing in the enterprise config will the corresponding field from personal configurat