ngs_built_in_agent_solo_builder_desc":"Rapidly build and ship pretty web apps","settings_built_in_agent_solo_coder_desc":"Tackle complex coding challenges","settings_conversation_auto_accept":"Auto-accept","settings_conversation_auto_run":"Auto-run","settings_conversation_todo_list":"To-Do List","settings_solo_mode_enabled_by_default":"SOLO mode is enabled by default","share generating":"Generating","share_link":"Share Link","shortcut_settings":"Shortcut Settings","show_doc":"Show Doc shortcut operations","show_history":"Show History","showcase_example_1_promo":"I want to build a women\u2019s fashion e-commerce site for US/Europe, inspired by Zara/H&M. Clean, modern, mobile-friendly. Pages: homepage (banner, new arrivals, bestsellers, new user popup), product list (with search and filters), product detail (images, size info, reviews). Shopping flow: cart, checkout, and payment (Visa, PayPal, Apple Pay, Klarna). Users can sign up/login with email, view orders, and enter shipping info during checkout. Include basic customer support via live chat or email. Visual style: black/white/gray with soft beige or navy accents, large product images, clean layout, subtle animations.Use icons with a unified style instead of emojis.\\nFor pages not yet implemented, please show an empty state with a \u201CComing Soon\u201D message.","showcase_example_1_title":"Build a shop website","showcase_example_2_promo":"I want to make a mood journal app where users can quickly log how they\u2019re feeling each day. Like, pick an emotion (happy, sad, anxious, calm, etc.), write a few lines, maybe add a photo or voice note.\\n\\nThe homepage should make it super easy to start a new entry. Also want a history page where I can scroll through or click a calendar to see past logs.\\n\\nI\u2019d love a trends page too \u2014 like a line chart showing how my mood changes over time, a word cloud of what I\u2019ve been writing about, and maybe a pie chart of my emotion breakdown.\\n\\nStyle-wise, I want something soft, simple, and calming \u2014 feels like self-care.","showcase_example_2_title":"Create a mood tracker","side_chat.fast_apply_partial_success":"Only part of the changes were applied successfully.","side_chat_bubble.error_detail_index":"Error #{index}","side_chat_bubble.info_detail_index":"Info #{index}","side_chat_bubble.tag_error_count":"{count} Error","side_chat_bubble.tag_info_count":"{count} Info","side_chat_bubble.tag_warn_count":"{count} Warning","side_chat_bubble.warn_detail_index":"Warning #{index}","side_chat_input.agent":"Agent","side_chat_input.code":"Code","side_chat_input.context":"Context","side_chat_input.context_tooltip":"Enter \'#\' to add context","side_chat_input.default_placeholder":"\'\u2191\u2193\' to navigate input history, \'\u21E7\u23CE\' to insert a new line","side_chat_input.default_placeholder_windows":"\'\u2191\u2193\' to navigate input history, \'Shift+Enter\' to insert a new line.","side_chat_input.file":"File","side_chat_input.folder":"Folder","side_chat_input.images":"Images","side_chat_input.images_tooltip":"Add Images","side_chat_input.model":"Model","side_chat_input.no_matching_result":"No matching results","side_chat_input.prompt_optimize":"Optimize your input","side_chat_input.prompt_optimize_disabled":"Please enter text first","side_chat_input.prompt_optimize_failed":"Optimization failed. Please try again.","side_chat_input.prompt_optimize_loading":"Optimizing your input\u2026","side_chat_input.prompt_optimize_revert":"Undo optimization","side_chat_input.prompt_optimize_timeout":"Optimization request timed out. Please try again.","side_chat_input.prompt_optimize_too_long":"Input is too long. Max length is 2000 characters.","side_chat_input.search_docs_by_name":"\uD83D\uDD0D Enter doc name to search","side_chat_input.search_docs_by_name_new":"Enter doc name to search","side_chat_input.search_files_by_name":"\uD83D\uDD0D Enter file name to search","side_chat_input.search_files_by_name_new":"Enter file name to searc